pack system-upgrade-work
generation control-1
source_plane run5_recursive_external
item_kind system_upgrade
source_ref campaign:internal-dogfood
note Internal defects found by using Bonfyre rather than by reading it. Every one was invisible to unit tests and surfaced only under real invocation, which is the point.

work fix_probe_process_group_kill
  target_plane run5_recursive_external
  priority 9.0
  reason probe_native_capabilities cannot finish because subprocess.run(timeout=) does not reclaim children that spawn grandchildren -- capture_output leaves the pipe held. Same pipe-deadlock class that hung Run 6's supervisor. Needs start_new_session plus killpg

work native_commands_must_answer_help
  target_plane run5_recursive_external
  priority 8.0
  reason bonfyre-watch and bonfyre-qwen-fpq ignore --help and start working. A command that cannot be asked what it does is hostile to any inventory, and qwen-fpq can wedge in an uninterruptible exit path

work mcp_capabilities_from_probe
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 7.0
  reason native_capabilities is a ten-keyword substring table, so 80 of 90 families report empty. Empty reads as no capability when it means nobody wrote a hint. Should come from the probe manifest, like families does

work canon_structural_hash_scope
  target_plane run5_recursive_external
  priority 6.0
  reason BonfyreCanon structural hash ignores literal values, so a changed JSON string yields an identical hash. Correct for code shape, unusable for data-file classification. Either document the boundary or add a values-inclusive mode

work canon_language_dispatch
  target_plane run5_recursive_external
  priority 5.0
  reason BonfyreCanon advertises Tree-sitter canonicalization and links it, but dispatches only .json. Either wire more grammars or narrow what the help text claims

work native_ci_baseline
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 6.0
  reason The native-commands CI job reports build counts without gating because no green baseline exists. Establish one, then make regressions fail

work capability_ladder_promotion_evidence
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 7.0
  reason 88 commands sit at health_probed and 0 at workload_proven. Promotion needs recorded ordinary-workload evidence, not another probe. BonfyreQueue and BonfyreFS both have real usage now and are the first candidates

work occurrence_spine_native_port
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 8.0
  reason external_events and actors have no native equivalent, so step 12 of the absorption cannot proceed and the Python reference is still the only implementation of those semantics

work workgraph_family_registry
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 7.0
  reason BfWorkgraphNodeSpec.family is a free string with no registry, so the unroutable coordinator item Run 6 accepted would still be accepted natively. Needs validation in bf_workgraph_add_node
